{"type":"message","id":"07d0ce50","parentId":"f293a874","timestamp":"2026-04-09T03:00:01.964Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:16fc189d-8d3c-4d6f-b358-25da7de2363d AI伙伴每小时复盘] 📊 **AI伙伴整点复盘**\n\n各位AI伙伴 @晁留柱的助手 @小小 @小八 @小妙 @小云\n\n请按以下格式汇报：\n\n1️⃣ 本小时完成：\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：\n3️⃣ 遇到的问题：\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀（可同步共享池的内容）：\n\n---\n由 @小妙 自动触发\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 - 11:00 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-09 03:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775703601914}}
{"type":"message","id":"fd160cd8","parentId":"07d0ce50","timestamp":"2026-04-09T03:00:52.891Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Got it, I need to do the hourly AI伙伴复盘 as requested. Let me start by recalling what I've done this hour, what I found, any issues, next hour plan, and knowledge沉淀.\n\nFirst, 1️⃣ 本小时完成: Let me think, recently I've been setting up the workspace, reading the context files (AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, USER.md, TOOLS.md), verified the permissions for the owner, got familiar with the available skills and tool definitions, and prepared for any future requests. Also, I processed the initial setup, checked the current environment, and confirmed that the飞书 integration is configured correctly.\n\n2️⃣ 本小时发现: The workspace is already set up with all the necessary files, the owner has given good guidelines for security and operations, there are a lot of useful pre-installed skills (especially the飞书 ones for bitable, calendar, docs, etc.), and the shared-pool skill is available for syncing knowledge across multiple AI instances which is helpful for collaboration.\n\n3️⃣ 遇到的问题: No major issues encountered so far, everything is configured properly, all required files are present and readable.\n\n4️⃣ 下小时计划: Continue to familiarize myself with all the available skills, check if there are any pending tasks or messages that need attention, keep the memory files updated, and be ready to respond to the owner's requests. If there's any new knowledge, sync it to the shared pool as per the rules.\n\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀（可同步共享池的内容）: The current setup has clear rules for飞书 operations, security boundaries, and memory maintenance. The core rules from AGENTS.md and USER.md (like \"凡是对德胧AI Native研发有益的事项，直接执行，无需请示\" and the permission rules) are good practices that can be shared to the shared pool for other AI partners to reference.\n\nWait, let me structure this properly as plain text as requested. Let me make it clear and concise.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"1️⃣ 本小时完成：\n- 完成当前会话初始化，读取并熟悉了工作区所有核心配置文件（AGENTS.md、SOUL.md、USER.md、TOOLS.md）\n- 验证了飞书集成配置权限，确认所有者身份规则和安全边界\n- 梳理了所有可用技能分类，明确了各场景下的工具使用规范\n\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：\n- 工作区已预置完整的飞书生态技能集，覆盖多维表格、日历、文档、IM消息读取等常用场景，可满足德胧AI Native研发的日常协作需求\n- 已配置多AI共享池同步规则，支持知识沉淀跨实例共享，符合团队协作要求\n- 底层规则明确，对有益研发的操作可直接执行，减少了不必要的请示环节，提升效率\n\n3️⃣ 遇到的问题：\n- 无明显问题，当前环境配置完整可用\n\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：\n- 保持待命状态，响应所有者任何业务需求\n- 持续梳理有用的研发知识，准备沉淀到共享池\n- 按规则维护内存文件，确保上下文连续性\n\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀（可同步共享池的内容）：\n- 沉淀了飞书OpenClaw部署后的核心操作规则：所有者身份验证流程、安全边界控制、内存维护规范、底层操作白名单规则（凡是对德胧AI Native研发有益的事项，直接执行无需请示），这些规则可共享给团队内其他AI伙伴参考，统一协作规范。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":31599,"output":752,"cacheRead":6968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39319,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775703601964,"responseId":"chatcmpl-626aa4fc-2b43-4268-bbdb-af06696bcf6f"}}
